y — what are you most proud of your body for?","closingLabel":"Worth celebrating","closingText":"you did not just survive this year. You healed, you rebuilt, and you settled into real, lasting strength — on your own timeline, the whole way through.","lookingAhead":"From here, the next phase continues into your second year of motherhood — still at your pace, still on your own timeline, exactly as it always has been.","progressionNote":null,"theme":"One year — settling into strength, for real","mantra":"You did not just get through this year. You became stronger through it.","childLearned":["Moved because she wanted to, not only because she had to.","Rested without guilt, and called it what it was: real work.","Asked for help, and asked herself the hard questions honestly, more than once.","Laughed while moving, and let that count for just as much as any rep.","Started again after difficult days, over and over, without giving up on herself."],"whatYouGaveYourself":null,"milestone":"One year ago, you were just beginning to meet each other. Today, you know each other completely.","breathLegacy":"The breath that carried you through pregnancy, birth, and this entire first year will keep carrying you through every year still ahead.","philosophy":"There's still no catching up to do. There's only the next step, whenever you're ready.","tiers":null,"signatureLine":null,"today":null,"finalNote":null,"clinicalFlag":null}$movejson$::jsonb WHERE week_number = 92;
