losingLabel":"Worth celebrating","closingText":"you did not just get through this stretch. You built a rhythm — chosen, sustainable, and fully yours — that will keep carrying you forward.","lookingAhead":"From here, the next phase continues into the second half of year two — still at your pace, still on your own timeline, exactly as it always has been.","milestone":"A year and a half ago, you were just settling into real strength. Today, you're living a rhythm that's entirely your own.","breathLegacy":"The breath that carried you through pregnancy, birth, and this whole journey so far will keep carrying you through everything still ahead.","philosophy":"There's still no catching up to do. There's only the next step, whenever you're ready.","finalNote":null,"signatureLine":null,"childLearned":["Chose movement because she wanted to, and let that be reason enough.","Stayed regulated through hard moments, more often than not.","Rested without needing to earn it first.","Kept her own body, her own choices, and her own rhythm — visibly, unapologetically hers."],"whatYouGaveYourself":null,"tiers":null,"recoveryRoute":null,"progressionNote":null,"move":null,"clinicalFlag":null}$movejson$::jsonb WHERE week_number = 118;
