UPDATE care_chart_week_content SET move = $movejson${"format":"sections","theme":"Two years — a real, whole close","mantra":"You did not just survive two years. You built a life within them.","reset":"360° Breathing, five rounds","today":"20 minutes of your choice, or however you'd like to mark this week","build":["Whichever movements feel most meaningful to you today"],"release":"360° Breathing, as long as feels good","door":null,"exercise":{"name":"360° Breathing (two-year marker)","focus":"the one practice that has outlasted two full years of change","benefit":"Every exercise in this whole journey has changed, progressed, or been replaced. This hasn't.","mistake":"None — there's no wrong way to do this today.","tip":"Just breathe, wide and unhurried, exactly the same way you did in week one of pregnancy."},"inRealLife":"This breath has now been with you through pregnancy, birth, healing, rebuilding, an entire first year, and now a complete second year — it will keep being useful for as long as you need it.","why":"Two full years ago, this journey began with a body just learning it was pregnant. Today, that same body has grown, delivered, healed, rebuilt, settled into strength, and built a genuinely sustainable, chosen rhythm across an entire second year.","quote":null,"note":null,"safety":"Consistency over intensity, still. Stop and seek care for pain above 4/10, new leaking or pelvic heaviness with exercise, joint pain that doesn't ease with rest, or anything that feels wrong. Persistent low mood, anxiety, or intrusive thoughts deserve real support at any point.","recovery":["A genuine sense of two full years of real change","Physical strength and stamina both meaningfully built","Mood steady, or supported if it isn't","Real trust in your own body, earned over two whole years"],"reflectionPrompt":"Two years on from week one — what are you most proud of, for both of you?","closingLabel":"Worth celebrating","closingText":"you did not just survive two years. You built real strength, real autonomy, and a real life within them — on your own timeline, the whole way through.","lookingAhead":"From here, the final phase begins — Year Three, the last stretch of this whole journey, closing at the third birthday.","milestone":"Two years ago, you were just beginning to meet each other. Today, you know each other completely, and you're both still growing.","breathLegacy":"The breath that carried you through pregnancy, birth, and two full years of motherhood will keep carrying you through everything still ahead.","philosophy":"There's still no catching up to do. There's only the next step, whenever you're ready.","finalNote":null,"signatureLine":null,"childLearned":["Adapted calmly instead of rigidly digging in.","Practised patience as a real skill, not just waited to run out of it.","Named her own complicated feelings honestly, instead of performing only happiness.","Kept building a life she was proud to be watched living."],"whatYouGaveYourself":null,"tiers":null,"recoveryRoute":null,"progressionNote":null,"move":null,"clinicalFlag":null}$movejson$::jsonb WHERE week_number = 144;
